---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    
    <h2>What Are Cookies</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit our website.</p>
    
    <h2>How We Use Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use cookies solely to maintain your session and enable you to stay logged in while using our site.</p>
    
    <h2>Session Cookies</h2>
    <p>Our website uses session cookies which are temporary and stored only on your browser.</p>
    
    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling cookies may prevent our website from functioning properly.</p>
    
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy on this page.</p>
    <p>Last updated: <time datetime="2025-05-01">May 1, 2025</time></p>   
</Layout>